# =============================================================================
# Wisemail API — env lives at the repo root
# =============================================================================
# Fastify loads `../../.env.local` (see `src/load-root-env.ts`).
#
#   cp ../../.env.example ../../.env.local
#   # then fill secrets in the root file
#
# Full variable list and comments: ../../.env.example
# SPA (Vite) variables: ../spa/.env.example
#
# Production (OCI): put the same keys in the process env / `/var/www/wisemail/.env`
# (see docs/deploy/OCI.md). Do not commit real secrets.
